    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/b12778759bee5ee3000afba70f6c276f.avif?t=1732996109\" width=610 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An orphaned young man from a poor foster family miraculously gets into the continent's most prestigious college. He has to leave his friends behind and venture into a new world. Love, friendship, sex, drugs, rocknroll, intrigue, conspiracies and humor are just some of the moments you will encounter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/b2c2c2d173f2e9fd03abb508c13b33f4.poster.avif?t=1732996109\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/b2c2c2d173f2e9fd03abb508c13b33f4.webm?t=1732996109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/b2c2c2d173f2e9fd03abb508c13b33f4.mp4?t=1732996109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reborn is a choice-driven adult Visual Novel (VN).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/0d3079fdbd721f17209e4e9311860ffd.avif?t=1732996109\" width=610 height=150 /></span>The plot centers on a young man who finds himself in a world alien to him. A world of status and prestige. The choices you make determine future events and also shape your character. A brash and reckless bully? Or a sweet and caring guy? It depends only on you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Girls in the game also have their own character and certain views. Their attitude to you depends on your choice. To be faithful and build a relationship with the girl of your dreams or to give yourself over to student life and let it consume you? After all, being a student is only a short period of life, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/50e74b240c292c2e55b6af03e99b563c.poster.avif?t=1732996109\" width=608 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/50e74b240c292c2e55b6af03e99b563c.webm?t=1732996109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/50e74b240c292c2e55b6af03e99b563c.mp4?t=1732996109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visual novel isn't limited to text-based storytelling. The game has interactivity in the form of mini-games, location exploration. Finding photo cards that unlock extra lewd illustrations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/d715949db4a58b2e66c831b21f950182.poster.avif?t=1732996109\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/d715949db4a58b2e66c831b21f950182.webm?t=1732996109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/d715949db4a58b2e66c831b21f950182.mp4?t=1732996109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is in early access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reborn - Season 1: New Life includes 4 acts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently available: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Act 1: Alien</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Act 2: Dead End</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Over 4,500 high quality renders. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 119 animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >96 music tracks (including a few of my own)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >62 sound effects </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Several hours of exciting gameplay. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide selection of tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/5351773942985a6d517beafb5bec4094.avif?t=1732996109\" width=610 height=153 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/b12778759bee5ee3000afba70f6c276f.avif?t=1732996109\" width=610 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An orphaned young man from a poor foster family miraculously gets into the continent's most prestigious college. He has to leave his friends behind and venture into a new world. Love, friendship, sex, drugs, rocknroll, intrigue, conspiracies and humor are just some of the moments you will encounter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/b2c2c2d173f2e9fd03abb508c13b33f4.poster.avif?t=1732996109\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/b2c2c2d173f2e9fd03abb508c13b33f4.webm?t=1732996109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/b2c2c2d173f2e9fd03abb508c13b33f4.mp4?t=1732996109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reborn is a choice-driven adult Visual Novel (VN).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/0d3079fdbd721f17209e4e9311860ffd.avif?t=1732996109\" width=610 height=150 /></span>The plot centers on a young man who finds himself in a world alien to him. A world of status and prestige. The choices you make determine future events and also shape your character. A brash and reckless bully? Or a sweet and caring guy? It depends only on you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Girls in the game also have their own character and certain views. Their attitude to you depends on your choice. To be faithful and build a relationship with the girl of your dreams or to give yourself over to student life and let it consume you? After all, being a student is only a short period of life, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/50e74b240c292c2e55b6af03e99b563c.poster.avif?t=1732996109\" width=608 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/50e74b240c292c2e55b6af03e99b563c.webm?t=1732996109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/50e74b240c292c2e55b6af03e99b563c.mp4?t=1732996109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visual novel isn't limited to text-based storytelling. The game has interactivity in the form of mini-games, location exploration. Finding photo cards that unlock extra lewd illustrations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/d715949db4a58b2e66c831b21f950182.poster.avif?t=1732996109\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/d715949db4a58b2e66c831b21f950182.webm?t=1732996109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/d715949db4a58b2e66c831b21f950182.mp4?t=1732996109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is in early access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reborn - Season 1: New Life includes 4 acts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently available: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Act 1: Alien</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Act 2: Dead End</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Over 4,500 high quality renders. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 119 animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >96 music tracks (including a few of my own)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >62 sound effects </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Several hours of exciting gameplay. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide selection of tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821860/extras/5351773942985a6d517beafb5bec4094.avif?t=1732996109\" width=610 height=153 /></span></p>",
